coordination/v1500-impl/cat05-r1/diff2.patch:20:+| 自由部署（「工具」抽屜展開） | R14 | 貼齊、密集兩個開關暫時多出來；收合時在上限內 | `game_place.gd` `_draw_place_hud` |
coordination/v1500-impl/cat05-r1/diff2.patch:21:+| 設定（剛套用一鍵預設） | R14 | 多一顆「撤回」，暫時 | `game_menus.gd` `_draw_settings` |
